   "en": "This crossing makes a satisfying Christchurch day without hiring a car. Ride to Lyttelton first, spend a little time in the port town, then walk toward Bridle Path Road and climb to the saddle. You finish on the city side of the hills instead of repeating the climb. The main track is short but steep, so plan it as a walk with a proper uphill section, not a flat stroll between cafés.",
   "zh": "不租车也能把基督城的一天过得很完整。先坐车到 Lyttelton，在港口小镇稍作停留，再走向 Bridle Path Road，翻过山口下到城市这一侧。这样不必为了取车再爬一次。主山道路程虽短，坡却陡；把它当作有实实在在上坡的一段徒步，而不是咖啡店之间的平路散步，会更符合体验。"
